OL,3,GNEWSACall to remove clothes banks over
OL,4,A'waste mountain'
OL,5,
OL,6,FClothes banks in a town in Derbyshire
OL,7,Fhave been described as a "Mount Everest
OL,8,Fof household waste" as donations pile
OL,9,Fup.
OL,11,FResidents say they are concerned about
OL,12,Fthe amount of recycling left outside a
OL,13,Frow of charity donation banks that are
OL,14,Fon private land and part of the Sinfin
OL,15,FShopping Centre in Derby.
OL,17,FBarbara Hall, who works for the Marie
OL,18,FCurie charity shop nearby, said Sinfin
OL,19,Fhad started to turn into "Sin-bin"
OL,20,Fbecause of the problem.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
